    Removed with the project templates of the add-in (as in MonoDevelop.DotNetCore): the New Project and New File
    dialogs list the templates of `dotnet new` and create projects with the CLI (T152, ADR 0026):
    - MonoDevelop.AspNetCore/AspNetCoreProjectTemplateWizard.cs: the template wizard, based on the removed
      DotNetCoreProjectTemplateWizard.
    - MonoDevelop.AspNetCore.Templating/AspNetCoreFileTemplateCondition.cs and AspNetCoreSdkInstalledCondition.cs: the
      conditions of the removed .xft.xml templates.
    Not built: MonoDevelop.AspNetCore.DevCertInstaller, the macOS helper that trusts the development certificate
    (ADR 0017).
  -->

  <ItemGroup>
    <EmbeddedResource Include="Properties/MonoDevelop.AspNetCore.addin.xml" />
